  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The ratio of the equivalent resistance of the network (shown in figure) between the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> when switch is open and switch is closed is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0189_7067e7014857.png\" style=\"width: 359px; height: 118px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When switch is closed</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>When open <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p>"
